Package: kind-minerd
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: d-Martian <d-Martian@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: apt-transport-tor
Recommends: tor
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/d-Martian/Kind-Miner
Description: Monero miner for a Nodo or any box with no screen
 kind-minerd mines Monero on P2Pool over Tor using only the CPU nothing else
 wants, and can serve p2pool to every other machine in the house. It is set
 up from the kind-miner desktop app, or over SSH with kind-minerd init.
 .
 The package ships xmrig and p2pool, upgrades itself weekly from its own
 repository over Tor, and goes back to the previous engines if new ones fail
 their health check.
